# With three players: Bot1's Curse enchants Bot2. When Bot3 (an opponent of the Curse's controller) attacks Bot2 with its Elvish Mystic, the trigger gives Bot1 a Gold token and "each opponent attacking that player does the same": Bot3 gets one too. Bot2, the enchanted player, gets none.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Curse of Opulence
Mountain x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Bot3 Deck]
Forest
Elvish Mystic
Forest x13

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Curse of Opulence.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot3.Main1]
Bot3.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot3.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot3.Hand.Elvish Mystic.Cast
Bot3.Pass
[T6 Bot3.Main1]
Bot3.Attack(Elvish Mystic > Bot2)
[T6 Bot3.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 3
Bot3.Battlefield.Count = 3
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
